  "description": "After his mother falls victim to a real estate scam, Kwon Sehyeon makes the big trek up to Seoul to start making money so he can buy her a place of her own. Tour after tour of different apartments makes him start to lose faith in his dream…until he finds a place that is nearly perfect. Fully furnished, sparkling clean, and at a steal of a price, this place has everything. And boy, is there everything…including a seductive spirit that strikes up a plan with Sehyeon to make his wildest dreams come true!\n\n_Source: Lezhin US_\n\n## Notes\n- This series is a global release, meaning all official translations come out on the same day as the original Korean.\n- The official English and T.Chinese tranlations are uncensored.",
